  fhir:description [ fhir:v "Maps the clinical mission phases in MissionPhaseCS to the coarser NASA medical-requirements timing phases in NASAMissionPhaseCS. Pre-flight maps to preflight activity, all in-space phases map to inflight, and both post-flight phases map to postflight."] ; # 
